00:58:43.260 --> 00:58:48.210
<v Tom>You and your left-wing liberal friends, trying to corner me, just like Michael Moore? Trying to ambush me?
<v Tom>你和你的左翼自由派朋友，像迈克尔·摩尔一样试图围堵我？试图伏击我？

